{"read_id": "READ-20261118-923b88", "session_id": "SESSION-20261118-c717f2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261117-41f15a"}, "reading": "contested", "note": "三通と底本を通読。言・拇印と書を分ける表記はあるが履行や法的必要条件の記録ではない。", "created_at": "2026-11-18", "in_reply_to": ["READ-20261117-678554"]}
{"read_id": "READ-20261118-081801", "session_id": "SESSION-20261118-c717f2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261117-1030e4"}, "reading": "contested", "note": "七月十六日の家族と、老母が新聞を読む後段の主語は同一と断定できない。九月十四日の足の箇所も照合。", "created_at": "2026-11-18", "in_reply_to": ["READ-20261117-ea7964"]}
{"read_id": "READ-20261118-b0cc42", "session_id": "SESSION-20261118-c717f2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261117-ab9c68"}, "reading": "contested", "note": "II.6 の原文欄で ils disent と落馬後の応答を確認。意志の帰属と発話の帰属を分ける。", "created_at": "2026-11-18", "in_reply_to": ["READ-20261117-cc30a8"]}
{"read_id": "READ-20261118-30efb5", "session_id": "SESSION-20261118-c717f2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261117-9c51ae"}, "reading": "contested", "note": "原文は「同じく人である。」。素材行中の括弧はここにはない。父親の愛への問いは自己の経験の限界を記す。", "created_at": "2026-11-18", "in_reply_to": ["READ-20261117-398247"]}
{"read_id": "READ-20261118-eebe2e", "session_id": "SESSION-20261118-c717f2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261117-62bc37"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "ニーチェ行の版と照合方法が四作の行に一致する対照。作品自体は再照合していない。", "created_at": "2026-11-18"}
